    "Opaque/stable key-reference semantics, lifecycle integration, producer-identity binding, privacy-safe audit acceptance, fail-closed stale/untrusted-key behavior, outage/degraded operation, recovery continuity, exact access-control isolation, and operational ownership remain pending until GoreeCloud-specific implementation or deployment evidence exists.",
